## 20. START NOW

Begin with **PHASE 0 — AUDIT THE ACTUAL REPOSITORY FIRST**. Inspect the real GitHub repo and all relevant documents. Then browse current primary standards/provider documentation, write the audit and research logs, reconcile overlapping sources of truth, refine the Auth & Security UI Integration Bible and contracts, validate the documents and verify all remote changes.

**Do not code components. Do not implement an authentication backend. Do not generate production assets or SFX. Audit first, research deeply, specify precisely, update the repository, validate, and report honestly.**
